+No fixed percentage is claimed. PIO capture and DMA movement are hardware-owned,
+but ring extraction, compression, queueing, and network transmission consume MCU
+time and must be measured with the exact input entropy and transport. The current
+HIL contract uses received sample count, not connection duration alone, as the
+throughput authority.
